  "title": "AssetCacheMissError",
  "description": "Raised when a cache-only acquisition found no record. A distinct type from AssetCacheError on purpose: an absent entry is the cache working correctly and reporting that it has nothing, while an `AssetCacheError` means a store could not answer at all. Only the second is a reason to suspect the storage backend.",
